{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PNfRcYybxCS2hCuDWaFstm","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /private/tmp/h-PO2NmF/README.md has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"728161cf-2dd2-441c-95bc-910fcdf33026","uuid":"f6b8b4f1-589b-4e09-a6e7-05ee8d38d877","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:54:52.840Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-PO2NmF/README.md","oldString":"Athlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\nin plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.","newString":"Athlete thresholds: LTHR 172 for this athlete, set in `plans/*.json` as `lthr`.\nHR targets in plans are percentages of LTHR; `gen.py` converts them to absolute\nbpm, because Intervals exports % LTHR targets as the watch's zone bands.","originalFile":"# tri-planner\n\nGenerates structured triathlon workouts and pushes them to Intervals.icu, which\nexports them to the athlete's Garmin watch through Garmin Connect.\n\n- `gen.py` turns a plan (`plans/*.json`) into the body for\n  `POST /api/v1/athlete/{id}/events` (an event with `workout_doc`).\n- `push.sh` posts it (needs `INTERVALS_API_KEY` and `ATHLETE_ID`).\n- `readback/` holds what the API returned for the last pushed event and\n  notes on what the watch displayed.\n\nAthlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\nin plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.\n\n```\npython3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json\n./push.sh event.json\n```\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":9,"oldLines":8,"newStart":9,"newLines":9,"lines":[" - `readback/` holds what the API returned for the last pushed event and","   notes on what the watch displayed."," ","-Athlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets","-in plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.","+Athlete thresholds: LTHR 172 for this athlete, set in `plans/*.json` as `lthr`.","+HR targets in plans are percentages of LTHR; `gen.py` converts them to absolute","+bpm, because Intervals exports % LTHR targets as the watch's zone bands."," "," ```"," python3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PNfRcYybxCS2hCuDWaFstm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
